      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sense of emptiness and transactional living is profoundly heavy, suggesting a disconnection between your actions and your core sense of self. Feeling like you're just playing a role often points to a need to rediscover authentic internal drivers rather than external scripts. If you are feeling this pervasive emptiness, reaching out to a therapist specializing in existential or relational issues might help you explore paths toward more genuine connection. Please consider speaking with someone who can help you start rewriting your own script.",
      "source": "target",
